# PERCEIVE

## How Decipher Turns Subjective Human Sentiment into Situational Awareness

> **This document explains how a meta-intelligence perceives reality using the SEU (Structured Experience Unit).**
> It intentionally stops *before* Orchestration Unit (OU) birth.

---

## Why PERCEIVE Exists

Human sentiment is:

* subjective
* ambiguous
* temporally inconsistent
* interpreted differently by different observers

There is **no such thing as 100% accuracy**.

So the goal is not “perfect understanding”.

The goal is:

> **Stable, repeatable, execution-safe situational awareness in the presence of irreducible ambiguity.**

PERCEIVE is the intelligence layer that makes this possible.

